OL,3,GNEWSATwo National Trust visitor centres
OL,4,Aand cafes to shut
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo National Trust visitor centres and
OL,7,Fcafes on the North Yorkshire coast will
OL,8,Fclose next month, the charity has
OL,9,Fconfirmed.
OL,11,FOld Coastguard Station in Robin Hood's
OL,12,FBay and a second site in Ravenscar are
OL,13,Fconsidered "no longer viable in the
OL,14,Flong term" by the charity, despite
OL,15,Fefforts to improve their performance.
OL,17,FAccording to the National Trust, both
OL,18,Fsites will cease trading and close to
OL,19,Fcustomers on 6 September.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
